ass=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两组的转化率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各组样本量。你不必现在就会算，只需记住一个直觉：样本量越小，随机波动越大，越容易把&quot;运气&quot;误读成&quot;效果&quot;。这就是为什么很多人看着两组数据&quot;一组高一组低&quot;就匆忙下结论，结果第二天数据又反过来了。</p>\n<p><strong>抽样为什么是命门？</strong> 调研结论的可信度，首先取决于样本能否代表你关心的总体。一个经典的反面教材是：只在某个高端社区门口发问卷，却拿结论去推断&quot;全城消费者偏好&quot;，再多的样本量也救不了这种系统性偏差。好的抽样追求随机和代表，而不是单纯追求&quot;人数多&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>AI 给调研带来了什么？</strong> 到 2026 年，AI 工具已渗透进调研的多个环节：帮你快速生成问卷草稿、把成千上万条开放式回答自动归类打标签、对访谈录音做转写和主题提炼。但要警惕——AI 擅长加速&quot;整理和归纳&quot;，却容易在缺乏真实数据时&quot;编造看似合理的结论&quot;。所以它是放大器而非替代品：输入垃圾，输出的就是更快、更像样的垃圾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>给你身边一家小店设计一个调研问题（如&quot;该不该上新品&quot;），先列出能用的二手数据来源，再判断哪些问题非做一手调研不可。</li>\n<li>区分以下哪些适合定性、哪些适合定量：用户为什么流失、新包装是否更受欢迎、品牌知名度有多高、客服话术该怎么改。</li>\n<li>思考题：一个 AB 测试只跑了一天，A 组转化率比 B 组高 2 个百分点，你能直接宣布 A 方案获胜吗？请结合样本量和随机波动说说你的顾虑。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《营销调研》（Naresh Malhotra）是这个领域的标准教材，对抽样和问卷设计有系统讲解。</li>\n<li>找一份你所在行业的公开研究报告，体会&quot;二手数据先行&quot;的省力之处。</li>\n<li>了解一下主流 AB 测试平台（如 Optimizely 这类）的入门文档，能帮你把统计显著性从抽象公式变成可操作的实践。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节的核心态度是：用证据代替直觉。记住调研的几条铁律——二手先于一手、定性发现假设、定量验证假设、抽样决定可信度。AI 让调研更快，但不能替你保证数据的真实与代表性。手里有了靠谱的信息，下一节我们就能进入真正的战略选择：把大市场切开，挑出最值得服务的那一块。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"市场调研方法","id":"市场调研方法"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"消费者决策过程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-principles-consumer-behavior/consumer-decision-process"},"next":{"title":"市场细分与目标选择","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/market-research-stp/market-segmentation-targeting"}}